+<!--
+THESIS: A precise working desk inside the EastSea visual system.
+OWN-WORLD: Paper, navy, gold; Newsreader titles, Geist controls, tabular data.
+STORY: Find an example, connect a wallet, inspect and execute its existing contract actions.
